WEBVTT

01:18.340 --> 01:21.870
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.920
[Episode 1]

01:33.410 --> 01:36.650
[Lujialai] [Exit, Line 2]

02:00.160 --> 02:01.620
I don't care where we meet.

02:01.720 --> 02:02.920
We must get him today.

02:03.000 --> 02:04.660
I'll be waiting for your news.

02:20.780 --> 02:21.940
[Back-office Dumbo]

02:26.780 --> 02:28.250
The crowded morning rush hour

02:28.070 --> 02:30.210
[Line 929, Bohua Road]

02:28.960 --> 02:29.840
is the warm embrace

02:29.840 --> 02:31.880
Shanghai gives to every worker bee.

02:32.780 --> 02:35.310
And then it delivers you
to your destination.

02:39.040 --> 02:40.400
This is Lujiazui,

02:40.660 --> 02:42.230
China's financial center

02:41.560 --> 02:42.540
[SWFC Observator]
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

02:42.250 --> 02:43.960
and a global financial hub.

02:44.570 --> 02:45.810
The people who work here

02:45.810 --> 02:46.930
are confident

02:47.010 --> 02:48.660
and highly motivated.

02:51.340 --> 02:52.260
Hello.

02:54.590 --> 02:55.630
Okay. Thank you.

02:55.630 --> 02:56.760
I'll be right there.

03:18.250 --> 03:19.990
I'm sorry.

03:33.110 --> 03:34.070
Welcome.

03:34.230 --> 03:35.000
Hello, sir.

03:35.020 --> 03:36.340
How can I help you?

03:36.370 --> 03:37.950
I'm looking for a women's handbag.

03:37.950 --> 03:39.360
Okay, this way please.

03:44.430 --> 03:45.079
This way.

03:49.090 --> 03:51.000
Here, you can take a look.

03:53.750 --> 03:55.329
The cut and fabric

03:55.360 --> 03:56.620
are really different.

03:59.710 --> 04:01.860
Only a suit like this suits him.

04:02.260 --> 04:04.140
Your boyfriend is so lucky.

04:05.310 --> 04:07.110
He won't be your boyfriend soon.

04:07.590 --> 04:09.230
Well then, congratulations in advance.

04:09.230 --> 04:09.950
Thank you.

04:10.860 --> 04:12.000
Okay, I'll take it.

04:12.180 --> 04:13.630
Wrap it up.
I'm giving it to someone as a gift.

04:13.630 --> 04:15.230
Okay, sir. This way, please.

04:21.149 --> 04:21.670
Excuse me,

04:21.670 --> 04:22.510
can I sit here?

04:24.680 --> 04:25.740
Thank you.

04:25.580 --> 04:29.960
[Health Maintenance]

04:27.150 --> 04:27.750
Excuse me.

04:27.990 --> 04:30.050
I'll have the same as this gentleman.

04:38.190 --> 04:39.150
Hello, Mr. Ma.

04:39.870 --> 04:40.270
Hello.

04:40.760 --> 04:42.110
I'm from Zhizhong Investment.

04:42.110 --> 04:43.170
My name is Li Yifei.

04:44.750 --> 04:46.150
Here is my business card.

04:49.580 --> 04:50.430
You know me?

04:50.830 --> 04:51.530
Actually,

04:51.550 --> 04:53.010
Actually, I've been wanting to set up
a meeting with you for a while.

04:53.010 --> 04:55.400
But I heard your schedule in Shanghai
is very full,

04:55.400 --> 04:57.060
so I had no choice
but to bother you during lunch.

04:55.470 --> 04:57.340
[Health Maintenance]

04:57.950 --> 04:59.280
You want to invest in me?

05:02.190 --> 05:03.470
Wha- What Investment?

05:04.310 --> 05:05.690
Zhizhong Investment.

05:06.150 --> 05:07.550
But the one interested in your company

05:07.550 --> 05:08.550
is actually me personally.

05:08.550 --> 05:10.230
I'd like to ask, this time,

05:10.590 --> 05:12.520
how much are you planning to raise?

05:15.310 --> 05:16.240
Twenty million.

05:17.550 --> 05:18.510
Twenty million?

05:20.670 --> 05:22.870
Okay, let's talk about your plan first.

05:23.690 --> 05:25.150
Tell me your budget first.

05:32.990 --> 05:33.770
Over here!

05:35.830 --> 05:36.590
Excuse me.

05:36.630 --> 05:38.909
One more tomato pork bone noodle soup
for this table, please.

05:38.909 --> 05:39.510
Thank you.

05:40.510 --> 05:42.190
Didn't you ask me to get takeout for you?

05:42.190 --> 05:43.710
Why did you come here to eat?

05:43.710 --> 05:44.580
Don't get me started.

05:44.580 --> 05:46.510
I'd be starving if I waited for you.

05:46.670 --> 05:48.070
Weren't you just
delivering some documents?

05:48.070 --> 05:49.530
Why did you buy something?

05:50.350 --> 05:51.990
I didn't want to take the risk of waiting.

05:51.990 --> 05:53.350
This is a limited edition.

05:53.350 --> 05:54.950
What if someone else buys it?

05:56.110 --> 05:57.510
I'll give this to him

05:57.510 --> 05:58.670
on his birthday tomorrow.

05:58.670 --> 05:59.870
Right on time.

06:00.710 --> 06:01.830
Limited edition?

06:01.870 --> 06:03.530
It's just a marketing tactic.

06:03.990 --> 06:04.980
Look at you.

06:05.150 --> 06:06.350
Just to save on delivery fees,

06:06.350 --> 06:08.080
you won't even order delivery.

06:08.150 --> 06:09.470
What did Wang Ruohai do to deserve you

06:09.470 --> 06:10.800
spending so much money on him?

06:10.800 --> 06:12.600
Doesn't he work in a bank?

06:12.760 --> 06:14.980
He needs a few nice suits.

06:15.360 --> 06:17.890
That's called an image investment,
you know?

06:18.110 --> 06:20.110
He's in a bank,
but you're in an investment bank.

06:20.110 --> 06:21.670
Why does he get to wear limited editions

06:21.670 --> 06:23.530
while you're so frugal every day?

06:23.990 --> 06:24.550
I...

06:25.680 --> 06:27.770
I work with data in the back office.

06:27.800 --> 06:30.260
Dressing like this
is perfectly fine for me.

06:31.270 --> 06:32.730
And maybe

06:33.060 --> 06:34.670
there will be another surprise.

06:34.670 --> 06:35.390
Surprise?

06:35.470 --> 06:36.330
What surprise?

06:38.710 --> 06:39.230
I...

06:39.470 --> 06:40.110
I'm sorry, sir.

06:40.110 --> 06:40.870
Sorry.

06:41.940 --> 06:44.350
They were just talking about
a 20-million investment,

06:44.350 --> 06:45.810
and now he's apologizing?

06:47.390 --> 06:47.870
Sorry.

06:48.630 --> 06:51.290
It's fine.
It's a knockoff and didn't cost much.

06:51.730 --> 06:53.120
I'll pay you back for it.

06:53.240 --> 06:54.800
No need.

07:01.110 --> 07:01.750
Hello?

07:05.230 --> 07:06.270
Director Fang?

07:07.590 --> 07:08.190
Okay.

07:09.270 --> 07:10.110
Director Fang?

07:10.110 --> 07:10.820
I'm leaving.

07:10.820 --> 07:11.950
You haven't finished your food.

07:11.950 --> 07:12.880
There's no time.

07:21.150 --> 07:22.350
Sorry, sorry.

07:25.090 --> 07:27.130
Boss, I knew you were here.

07:27.170 --> 07:28.900
Why didn't you answer my calls?

07:29.110 --> 07:29.870
What's wrong?

07:29.870 --> 07:31.270
Something big happened.

07:31.630 --> 07:32.490
What happened?

07:32.760 --> 07:35.850
[Zhizhong Construction Investment Securities Co., Ltd]

07:42.750 --> 07:43.950
Is everything ready?

07:43.990 --> 07:44.770
Yes.

07:45.220 --> 07:48.240
Director Fang, Huang Shusong
was taken away by the police.

07:48.240 --> 07:50.280
He's not the only one
at Zhizhong Investment.

07:50.280 --> 07:51.540
Hurry up and get ready.

07:51.750 --> 07:52.350
Okay.

07:52.640 --> 07:53.980
Where is Qian Fei from the back office?

07:53.980 --> 07:54.830
I've already notified her.

07:54.830 --> 07:56.300
She should be here any minute.

07:56.300 --> 07:57.150
Keep pushing her.

07:57.150 --> 07:57.740
Okay.

07:59.990 --> 08:01.910
Director Fang, you're looking for me?

08:01.910 --> 08:02.440
Let's go.

08:02.710 --> 08:03.390
Where to?

08:03.830 --> 08:05.190
Just go when you're told. Stop talking.

08:05.190 --> 08:05.800
Let's go.

08:08.550 --> 08:09.390
Director Fang.

08:09.390 --> 08:10.250
Director Fang.

08:11.900 --> 08:13.610
I didn't expect Huang to be so corrupt.

08:13.610 --> 08:15.040
You never worked with him before,

08:15.040 --> 08:16.240
so you might not know.

08:16.670 --> 08:18.510
He is in charge of
Shanlifang Hotel Group's

08:18.510 --> 08:19.350
IPO bidding.

08:19.350 --> 08:21.150
The deadline is 2:00 PM today.

08:23.070 --> 08:25.220
Here is the information
on Shanlifang Hotel Group.

08:25.220 --> 08:26.480
Take a quick look.

08:28.500 --> 08:28.970
[Shanlifang Hotel&Tourism is one of
the core businesses of the group]

08:28.700 --> 08:29.230
What do you mean?

08:28.990 --> 08:30.460
[Customer Plan]

08:29.230 --> 08:30.390
You want to hand the project over to me?

08:30.390 --> 08:31.850
Aren't there other teams?

08:31.940 --> 08:35.940
The chairman of Shanlifang specifically
asked you to lead the bidding.

08:36.510 --> 08:37.440
What did you say?

08:37.549 --> 08:39.860
Mr. Liao specifically named me?

08:40.309 --> 08:41.590
Yes, Liao Jinshan.

08:42.309 --> 08:43.190
Do you know him?

08:45.990 --> 08:47.390
Who doesn't know him?

08:48.230 --> 08:50.430
Who is our competitor for this project?

08:50.950 --> 08:52.110
He Jing Securities.

08:55.990 --> 08:58.070
You're that
"Back-office Dumbo" who exposed

08:58.070 --> 08:59.330
Huang Shusong, right?

09:02.030 --> 09:02.950
I didn't expose him.

09:02.950 --> 09:05.110
I just analyzed some public data

09:05.110 --> 09:07.110
and raised some obvious questions.

09:07.470 --> 09:08.530
Don't be so modest.

09:09.790 --> 09:11.450
Huang Shusong is a sly old fox.

09:11.590 --> 09:12.670
He is so cautious.

09:12.670 --> 09:14.040
Finding clues to his corruption

09:14.040 --> 09:14.830
wasn't easy.

09:15.670 --> 09:18.330
You deserve the credit
for his arrest this time.

09:19.330 --> 09:20.310
[13:34]

09:20.330 --> 09:20.820
[13:35]

09:26.810 --> 09:28.460
Boss, how much longer will it take?

09:28.460 --> 09:29.190
Almost done.

09:29.610 --> 09:31.020
Modifying the bid now is too much

09:31.020 --> 09:32.780
of a gamble. Don't you think?

09:34.150 --> 09:36.590
Mr. Liao specifically named me.

09:36.710 --> 09:38.430
Of course I have to prove my worth.

09:38.430 --> 09:38.990
Alright.

09:45.740 --> 09:47.500
The people from Zhizhong
haven't arrived yet.

09:47.500 --> 09:48.960
Bidding closes at 2:00.

09:49.030 --> 09:50.190
We'll guard the entrances

09:50.190 --> 09:51.670
and find a way to stop them.

09:51.750 --> 09:53.110
That way, they'll be out.

09:53.110 --> 09:54.140
I'll send you

09:54.160 --> 09:55.430
the plates of their usual cars

09:55.430 --> 09:56.250
in a bit.

09:56.350 --> 09:57.680
Keep a close eye on them.

09:58.950 --> 10:00.470
There are so many people at the entrance.

10:00.470 --> 10:01.530
If I were from Zhizhong,

10:01.530 --> 10:02.990
-I definitely wouldn't use this main entrance.
-Come on.

10:02.990 --> 10:04.110
You're not one of them.

10:04.110 --> 10:06.720
How do you know
they won't use this entrance?

10:06.790 --> 10:08.370
Alright, just in case.

10:08.670 --> 10:09.200
Let's go.

10:13.870 --> 10:14.670
They're here.

10:16.620 --> 10:18.750
Right on time. Let's get out of the car.

10:18.900 --> 10:19.490
[13:55]

10:19.510 --> 10:20.250
[13:56]

10:25.750 --> 10:27.190
Making me wait for the people
from Zhizhong—

10:27.190 --> 10:30.250
how am I supposed to handle this
with so many entrances?

10:47.030 --> 10:47.910
Sorry, sorry.

10:48.050 --> 10:48.780
Are you okay?

10:51.150 --> 10:51.750
You...

10:52.350 --> 10:52.910
You...

10:53.070 --> 10:53.510
You...

10:53.930 --> 10:54.590
-You...
-You...

10:54.590 --> 10:54.950
You...

10:54.950 --> 10:55.630
You... Aren't you...

10:55.630 --> 10:56.560
Twenty million?

10:57.070 --> 10:58.430
Twenty million?

11:00.390 --> 11:01.520
I see.

11:01.540 --> 11:04.350
You've been following me
since this morning, haven't you?

11:04.350 --> 11:05.350
Well, well, well.

11:05.800 --> 11:07.430
Your company is really something.

11:07.430 --> 11:07.790
What?

11:07.820 --> 11:10.350
Are you setting up a whole trap
just to stop me?

11:12.430 --> 11:14.560
Do you know what "unstoppable" means?

11:19.940 --> 11:21.780
Is he kidding me?

11:21.810 --> 11:22.770
How baffling.

11:31.410 --> 11:33.390
[Naranmad Bank]

11:48.190 --> 11:49.710
For just a 10 million loan,

11:49.740 --> 11:50.690
the chairman's daughter doesn't need

11:50.690 --> 11:52.950
to show up in person every time, does she?

11:53.230 --> 11:54.430
Our Manager Wang

11:54.460 --> 11:57.060
is probably more charming
than the 10 million.

12:08.470 --> 12:09.580
Ms. Liao, please.

12:09.870 --> 12:10.910
Am I early?

12:11.710 --> 12:12.350
No.

12:12.670 --> 12:15.270
The contract is ready.
Let's sit down and talk.

12:22.540 --> 12:26.940
[Bidding Document]

12:34.890 --> 12:36.430
[13:58]

12:36.450 --> 12:36.870
[13:59]

12:38.030 --> 12:39.690
Everyone, please be patient.

12:39.910 --> 12:41.310
There's one minute left.

12:59.280 --> 13:00.690
[13:59]

13:00.720 --> 13:01.820
[14:00]

13:16.830 --> 13:18.560
Excuse me, everyone. Am I late?

13:19.070 --> 13:20.130
Please have a seat.

13:21.230 --> 13:21.870
Sit.

13:24.230 --> 13:26.860
I am Li Yifei from Zhizhong Investment.

13:28.760 --> 13:30.220
This is our bid.

13:32.740 --> 13:34.250
[Bidding Document]

13:47.780 --> 13:50.150
I will have the legal team
review this contract

13:50.150 --> 13:52.230
and give you a final answer within 3 days.

13:52.230 --> 13:54.490
But in my opinion, there are no problems.

13:54.630 --> 13:56.390
I trust your work.

13:57.110 --> 13:59.040
Thank you for your trust, Ms. Liao.

13:59.430 --> 14:00.560
Director Fang.

14:00.870 --> 14:01.950
May I know

14:01.980 --> 14:03.980
why you took me to the bidding today?

14:04.220 --> 14:05.680
Answer my question first.

14:07.590 --> 14:08.910
You are a top student

14:08.910 --> 14:11.770
from a university of finance
and economics, right?

14:11.790 --> 14:14.390
You've always performed well
since you came to He Jing.

14:14.390 --> 14:16.620
The projects you've handled
in the past 3 years

14:16.620 --> 14:18.020
have no record of rework.

14:18.230 --> 14:20.510
But you are content
to stay behind the scenes.

14:20.510 --> 14:22.220
Not long ago,
you turned down the HR department's

14:22.220 --> 14:23.960
offer to join our project team.

14:24.250 --> 14:24.890
Why?

14:27.150 --> 14:27.810
Because...

14:29.030 --> 14:30.230
I'm getting married.

14:34.390 --> 14:36.280
Thanks for your help
with the loan this time.

14:36.280 --> 14:38.030
To celebrate our successful cooperation,

14:38.030 --> 14:39.560
let's have dinner tonight.

14:42.090 --> 14:43.450
Tonight, I...

14:43.470 --> 14:44.530
Then it's settled?

14:47.300 --> 14:47.900
Okay.

14:50.990 --> 14:53.480
Love is not everlasting

14:53.670 --> 14:54.870
or unchanging.

14:56.190 --> 14:58.390
And marriage is not a guarantee of love.

14:58.510 --> 14:59.840
A wife's role

15:00.550 --> 15:01.810
is not irreplaceable.

15:05.470 --> 15:06.930
That's just your opinion.

15:08.670 --> 15:10.270
Having a happy family

15:10.390 --> 15:11.690
is my goal,

15:12.190 --> 15:13.460
and his goal too.

15:17.160 --> 15:20.190
I believe we are irreplaceable

15:20.270 --> 15:22.040
to each other.

15:22.430 --> 15:24.710
I am sure of that.

15:27.460 --> 15:30.390
Everyone has their own ambitions.
I won't force you.

15:30.750 --> 15:33.480
I just want to remind you
not to waste your talent.

15:34.190 --> 15:36.320
I thought you had untapped potential.

15:36.710 --> 15:37.570
Director Fang,

15:38.340 --> 15:40.880
thank you so much
for telling me this today.

15:41.630 --> 15:42.630
It's just that...

15:43.750 --> 15:46.010
everyone cares about different things.

15:50.660 --> 15:52.460
Oh, right, the membership card.

15:53.200 --> 15:54.360
Just leave it there.

15:55.350 --> 15:58.390
How much effort did you put into this?

15:58.420 --> 16:01.090
It's such a waste of time.

16:01.190 --> 16:01.830
You know what?

16:01.830 --> 16:04.830
You're the 3rd person today to say
I'm wasting things.

16:05.430 --> 16:06.870
Am I really

16:06.910 --> 16:08.580
that hopeless in your eyes?

16:08.830 --> 16:09.430
Exactly.

16:10.050 --> 16:13.040
Bystanders see things clearly.

16:14.470 --> 16:16.670
If you just center your life around a man

16:16.750 --> 16:18.230
and don't develop yourself,

16:18.230 --> 16:20.210
you'll regret it sooner or later.

16:20.750 --> 16:22.480
I really did get acknowledged.

16:23.030 --> 16:23.660
You know what?

16:23.660 --> 16:26.110
Director Fang actually asked me
to join their project team.

16:26.110 --> 16:28.670
Really? That's great.

16:30.750 --> 16:32.470
Don't tell me you rejected it again.

16:32.470 --> 16:33.630
Of course I did.

16:33.660 --> 16:35.410
Front-end work is so exhausting.

16:35.410 --> 16:37.550
Everyone looks absolutely miserable.

16:37.550 --> 16:38.350
Other than work,

16:38.350 --> 16:39.350
there's no time for anything else.

16:39.350 --> 16:40.520
How could I go?

16:40.590 --> 16:41.190
You know,

16:41.230 --> 16:42.740
people like us
who work 9-to-6 with weekends off

16:42.740 --> 16:45.100
are the real scarce resources.

16:46.230 --> 16:46.790
Seriously,

16:46.790 --> 16:48.790
I don't even know what to say to you.

16:49.670 --> 16:51.000
Are you out of your mind?

16:55.920 --> 16:58.740
[The Owner's Signature: Qian Fei]

16:59.670 --> 17:00.260
Thanks.

17:00.390 --> 17:01.770
I'm very satisfied.

17:01.830 --> 17:02.630
Thank you.

17:02.740 --> 17:03.590
Thanks for your recognition.

17:03.590 --> 17:04.339
If you have any questions,

17:04.339 --> 17:05.710
contact our after-sales service anytime.

17:05.710 --> 17:06.470
Okay, thank you.

17:06.470 --> 17:08.800
-Let me see you off.
-I'll leave you alone.

17:09.470 --> 17:10.190
Thank you.

17:10.220 --> 17:10.950
Okay, bye.

17:11.020 --> 17:11.710
Bye.

17:18.150 --> 17:19.020
Great.

17:19.020 --> 17:20.910
Finally, I have my own house.

17:22.069 --> 17:22.790
Can you estimate

17:22.790 --> 17:24.790
how long it'll take to sell my house?

17:24.950 --> 17:26.390
Your listing price,

17:26.430 --> 17:27.710
although a bit high,

17:27.710 --> 17:29.270
is still much cheaper

17:29.430 --> 17:30.950
compared to the market price.

17:30.950 --> 17:31.880
It'll sell fast.

17:32.630 --> 17:34.230
I only have one requirement.

17:34.550 --> 17:35.350
Full payment.

17:35.430 --> 17:37.870
By the way,
about the house I want to rent,

17:37.870 --> 17:39.150
please keep an eye out for me.

17:39.150 --> 17:39.510
Okay.

17:39.710 --> 17:40.870
Anyway, the requirements

17:40.870 --> 17:42.190
are what I just told you.

17:42.190 --> 17:43.270
Okay, don't worry.

17:43.390 --> 17:45.190
We have plenty of listings here.

17:46.590 --> 17:47.750
You again?

17:56.730 --> 17:58.650
You followed me all the way here?

17:58.670 --> 17:59.720
Will you ever stop?

17:59.720 --> 18:01.150
What do you mean by following you?

18:01.150 --> 18:02.480
I just happened to pass by.

18:02.480 --> 18:03.880
And I finally caught you.

18:05.030 --> 18:06.430
What exactly do you want?

18:06.990 --> 18:08.270
You broke my phone.

18:08.300 --> 18:08.960
Pay me back.

18:10.270 --> 18:11.470
Isn't it perfectly fine?

18:11.470 --> 18:12.380
I just got it fixed to—

18:12.380 --> 18:14.110
Find a better excuse next time.

18:15.430 --> 18:16.090
You...

18:18.970 --> 18:20.720
[Choose Experts for Your Home]

18:41.110 --> 18:42.970
How about we grab dinner tonight?

18:45.270 --> 18:45.790
Let's go.

18:45.790 --> 18:48.030
No, thank you. Um...

18:48.470 --> 18:50.280
I have an appointment later.

18:51.950 --> 18:52.390
Okay.

18:54.830 --> 18:56.830
I really enjoyed our chat today.

19:01.830 --> 19:02.700
Are you sure you don't need a ride?

19:02.700 --> 19:04.530
I'm sure. Thank you.

19:04.670 --> 19:06.200
Alright, I'll be going now.

19:07.390 --> 19:08.390
Drive safe.

19:08.510 --> 19:09.710
Have fun.

19:09.710 --> 19:10.230
Okay.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.230
Bye-bye.

19:11.270 --> 19:12.670
See you tomorrow night. Don't forget.

19:12.670 --> 19:13.320
Bye-bye.

19:26.590 --> 19:28.250
Why are you so late?

19:28.470 --> 19:29.710
I'm starving.

19:35.590 --> 19:36.350
Yifei.

19:39.870 --> 19:40.430
What's going on?

19:40.430 --> 19:41.590
I love you so much!

19:44.030 --> 19:45.390
How did you know

19:45.420 --> 19:47.620
I needed a new bag for next week's event?

19:47.830 --> 19:49.190
This... is not for you.

19:50.870 --> 19:53.230
It's for Jun's parents' 30th anniversary.

19:53.230 --> 19:55.160
This is a gift I helped his dad pick.

19:57.950 --> 20:00.420
So you never go shopping with me,

20:00.510 --> 20:02.030
but you bought a gift for someone else?

20:02.030 --> 20:02.830
Next time. I promise.

20:02.830 --> 20:05.160
Aren't I going to have dinner
with you now?

20:09.310 --> 20:10.580
So annoying.

20:14.990 --> 20:17.160
[Art Center]

20:33.230 --> 20:34.100
Ruohai.

20:41.670 --> 20:42.870
Do you still remember

20:43.390 --> 20:44.990
the girl you saved back then?

20:46.990 --> 20:47.670
It was you?

20:49.270 --> 20:50.060
I can't believe it.

20:50.060 --> 20:51.340
After all these years,

20:52.470 --> 20:54.670
you're still as beautiful as back then.

20:55.870 --> 20:57.830
My adolescence

20:58.070 --> 21:00.180
was the darkest time of my life.

21:00.870 --> 21:03.270
Your bright spirit
gave me so much support.

21:04.350 --> 21:05.830
After all these years,

21:06.670 --> 21:08.070
you're still so positive

21:09.000 --> 21:11.050
and resilient.

21:26.190 --> 21:27.110
Hey, Ruohai.

21:27.270 --> 21:28.730
Guess where I am right now.

21:29.550 --> 21:31.620
I'm at our new house.

21:32.710 --> 21:34.070
I'm really happy with the renovation,

21:34.070 --> 21:36.530
and the colors make the place
feel very cozy.

21:37.550 --> 21:39.550
You should be arriving soon, right?

21:43.110 --> 21:44.450
Alright, you get back to work.

21:44.450 --> 21:45.780
The client comes first.

21:46.630 --> 21:48.630
I'll be waiting for you at home then.

21:49.150 --> 21:50.870
I also have a surprise for you.

21:52.800 --> 21:53.650
Okay.

21:54.070 --> 21:54.790
See you.

22:04.590 --> 22:05.150
How about this?

22:05.150 --> 22:07.550
Open this bottle of champagne
for us first.

22:12.070 --> 22:13.220
Your carried interest
for the second half of the year

22:13.220 --> 22:14.680
will probably be pitiful.

22:15.590 --> 22:17.270
Do you really think
you're a trust fund baby?

22:17.270 --> 22:20.000
You might as well just focus on
how to spend money.

22:21.750 --> 22:22.690
Even my dad

22:23.990 --> 22:25.520
doesn't trust me that much.

22:27.990 --> 22:30.690
So you guys
have your own difficulties too.

22:32.830 --> 22:34.790
That's why I need someone trustworthy

22:34.790 --> 22:35.940
to stay by my side

22:35.970 --> 22:37.570
and help me wholeheartedly.

22:38.510 --> 22:39.620
And that's you.

22:41.310 --> 22:43.480
Me? How can I help you?

22:44.110 --> 22:46.210
I want to invite you to join Shanlifang

22:46.210 --> 22:48.130
as the group's CFO.

22:48.470 --> 22:50.550
Do I have the honor?

22:51.670 --> 22:52.540
I can't.

22:52.910 --> 22:55.350
Being a CFO and my current job

22:55.550 --> 22:57.080
are completely different.

22:57.310 --> 22:58.970
I'm afraid I'm not qualified.

23:00.070 --> 23:02.630
This loan
has already shown your capabilities.

23:02.630 --> 23:05.230
Not just me—
my dad also highly approves of you.

23:07.240 --> 23:09.240
Advancing carefully and steadily.

23:09.750 --> 23:11.210
She's about to be won over.

23:12.150 --> 23:13.680
What are you talking about?

23:13.870 --> 23:15.030
That guy.

23:15.650 --> 23:18.380
Look at his expression.
It's totally unnatural.

23:18.990 --> 23:20.890
He probably sneaked out for a date.

23:20.890 --> 23:23.090
I hate sneaky people like that the most.

23:23.800 --> 23:25.530
You sure have a lot of free time.

23:32.590 --> 23:33.390
So green?

23:35.510 --> 23:38.470
Like a grassland—healthy, green,

23:38.510 --> 23:39.990
and good for detoxing and your skin.

23:39.990 --> 23:40.590
Enjoy.

23:44.430 --> 23:45.190
After we finish eating and go back,

23:45.190 --> 23:46.540
hurry up and pack your things.

23:46.540 --> 23:47.740
I'm planning to move.

23:48.910 --> 23:50.440
Are you getting a new house?

23:50.950 --> 23:52.840
Not really. I need money,

23:53.180 --> 23:54.060
so I sold my house.

23:54.060 --> 23:56.520
With your current income,
there's no way...

23:57.620 --> 23:59.070
Are you afraid that

23:59.550 --> 24:01.750
since I don't even have a house anymore,

24:02.070 --> 24:03.300
I'll be even less worthy of you?

24:03.300 --> 24:04.310
What am I afraid of?

24:04.310 --> 24:05.970
At worst, we'll just break up.

24:06.390 --> 24:07.310
Hearing you gaslight me like that,

24:07.310 --> 24:08.440
I'm really touched.

24:13.630 --> 24:16.030
So where will you live
if you sell the house?

24:16.030 --> 24:16.630
I'll rent.

24:20.330 --> 24:20.930
Rent?

24:23.430 --> 24:24.230
Li Yifei, have you

24:24.230 --> 24:26.130
never thought about marrying me?

24:28.430 --> 24:29.860
You said yourself

24:30.350 --> 24:32.350
that you want to stay single forever

24:32.590 --> 24:35.250
and won't consider marriage before 40.

24:35.350 --> 24:36.270
You told me not to overthink it.

24:36.270 --> 24:37.070
Didn't you say that?

24:37.070 --> 24:38.270
I can think that way,

24:38.300 --> 24:40.900
but you can't have no plans at all.

24:41.030 --> 24:43.350
You never planned to give me a home.

24:45.550 --> 24:46.860
You don't plan to marry me,

24:46.860 --> 24:49.190
but I have to be ready
to marry you anytime,

24:49.210 --> 24:51.210
and have a big house waiting for you.

24:51.550 --> 24:53.210
Is that fair?

24:53.870 --> 24:55.870
I just want you to love me

24:55.870 --> 24:57.110
a little more than I love you.

24:57.110 --> 24:58.300
Is that wrong?

25:03.590 --> 25:05.250
We are preparing to go public.

25:05.270 --> 25:06.230
At Shanlifang,

25:06.590 --> 25:08.340
in less than 3 years,

25:08.430 --> 25:10.150
you can achieve what takes 10

25:10.190 --> 25:11.670
or even 20 years in a bank.

25:13.910 --> 25:15.440
I know this is a big deal,

25:15.790 --> 25:17.690
and you can't make a hasty decision.

25:17.690 --> 25:19.190
Give yourself some time.

25:20.390 --> 25:21.320
The world is big.

25:22.630 --> 25:24.030
But if you trap yourself,

25:24.140 --> 25:26.120
your world will become very small.

25:27.070 --> 25:28.070
Shanlifang is an excellent stage

25:28.070 --> 25:30.230
for you to show what you're capable of.

25:31.390 --> 25:32.790
Let's work together

25:33.470 --> 25:35.870
and build a better future for it,

25:36.070 --> 25:36.550
okay?

26:23.300 --> 26:24.660
[Happy birthday, Ruohai.
We'll be together forever!]

26:32.350 --> 26:32.830
Ruohai.

26:33.220 --> 26:36.070
I saw a watch when I was shopping today.

26:37.080 --> 26:38.140
Try it on for me.

26:47.150 --> 26:48.480
Who did you buy this for?

26:49.550 --> 26:50.590
This watch

26:50.990 --> 26:53.510
is a token of my sincerity
in inviting you to join Shanlifang.

26:53.510 --> 26:55.110
When you're unsure, wear it.

26:55.230 --> 26:57.310
I hope it can help you make a decision.

27:08.790 --> 27:09.590
You're awake?

27:10.990 --> 27:12.600
You're back?

27:13.480 --> 27:15.890
You're finally back. You've worked hard.

27:16.870 --> 27:18.800
I was with a client until very late.

27:22.510 --> 27:23.640
It's past midnight.

27:24.550 --> 27:25.170
I'm sorry.

27:26.110 --> 27:26.800
It's fine.

27:26.870 --> 27:27.800
Happy birthday.

27:27.870 --> 27:28.510
Thank you.

27:29.650 --> 27:31.010
Look at the card I wrote for you.

27:30.210 --> 27:30.720
[Happy birthday, Ruohai.
We'll be together forever!]

27:31.040 --> 27:32.030
I already read it.

27:32.030 --> 27:33.030
Then hurry up and open your gift.

27:33.030 --> 27:34.150
You'll definitely like it.

27:34.150 --> 27:35.410
Open it and take a look.

27:36.110 --> 27:37.040
I'll do it later.

27:39.830 --> 27:40.230
Okay.

27:40.870 --> 27:41.530
Come here.

27:42.030 --> 27:44.170
We finally have our own house.

27:44.470 --> 27:45.120
How do you like it?

27:45.120 --> 27:47.050
Isn't this color scheme very cozy?

27:48.460 --> 27:49.790
Finally we have a place to settle down,

27:49.790 --> 27:52.390
so we won't have to
live a wandering life anymore.

27:52.390 --> 27:54.590
I have something important to tell you.

27:56.430 --> 27:57.270
What is it?

27:58.950 --> 27:59.790
Here it goes.

28:09.190 --> 28:10.110
I changed jobs.

28:11.490 --> 28:12.910
I moved to a new company

28:12.950 --> 28:13.920
as their CFO.

28:15.470 --> 28:16.680
CFO?

28:18.110 --> 28:19.070
Is it reliable?

28:19.100 --> 28:20.820
Yes, it's a big company.

28:23.950 --> 28:24.790
That's great.

28:24.910 --> 28:25.760
Why are there

28:26.270 --> 28:27.940
so many pieces of good news today?

28:27.940 --> 28:29.130
It's your birthday,

28:29.160 --> 28:31.790
we got our new house,

28:31.820 --> 28:33.360
and you got a new job.

28:33.870 --> 28:36.740
Is there a 4th thing?

28:38.370 --> 28:39.050
No.

28:41.710 --> 28:42.350
No?

28:43.500 --> 28:44.500
What should it be?

28:47.950 --> 28:50.030
Wait. Are you unhappy?

28:51.150 --> 28:52.430
-No.
-It's okay, Qian Fei.

28:52.430 --> 28:54.460
Just tell me what's on your mind.

28:55.910 --> 28:56.710
It's just...

28:57.870 --> 29:00.790
I thought
you were going to propose to me today.

29:12.950 --> 29:15.590
Why are we talking about this?

29:17.190 --> 29:18.190
The other day,

29:18.750 --> 29:20.050
your mom called me

29:20.070 --> 29:22.430
and said you were going to propose.

29:22.510 --> 29:24.850
She told me
to quickly book the wedding banquet,

29:24.850 --> 29:27.750
so I paid the deposit.

29:30.600 --> 29:32.860
No one ever told me about this.

29:38.070 --> 29:39.150
So my mom wants to come here

29:39.150 --> 29:41.070
and force us to get married, right?

29:41.070 --> 29:41.920
No.

29:42.950 --> 29:44.990
Qian Fei, why didn't you tell me?

29:46.520 --> 29:49.850
Because... I thought
you were going to surprise me,

29:49.990 --> 29:51.590
so I pretended I didn't know.

29:55.780 --> 29:56.670
But look,

29:56.910 --> 29:59.670
our wedding banquet is already booked,

29:59.990 --> 30:03.950
-and didn't we already take our wedding photos last time?
-Fei, did you forget about
the wedding photos?

30:03.950 --> 30:05.510
We went to take couple photos.

30:05.510 --> 30:06.910
You said that dress looked nice

30:06.910 --> 30:08.040
I wanted to try it on.

30:08.510 --> 30:10.510
So we just casually took a few shots.

30:10.990 --> 30:12.120
That doesn't count.

30:13.300 --> 30:14.900
Well, if that doesn't count,

30:15.230 --> 30:17.030
this house should count, right?

30:17.710 --> 30:19.350
Your dad bought this house.

30:20.470 --> 30:21.460
I'm a man.

30:22.030 --> 30:23.850
How can I marry you in a house

30:23.870 --> 30:24.830
your dad bought?

30:25.110 --> 30:27.370
It's a house bought by your dad after all.

30:28.030 --> 30:29.470
What year is it?

30:29.510 --> 30:30.970
Don't overthink it, okay?

30:31.310 --> 30:33.030
Even though
my family paid the down payment,

30:33.030 --> 30:35.150
you still pay the mortgage every month.

30:35.150 --> 30:36.610
Speaking of the mortgage,

30:38.110 --> 30:40.840
do you know
how much pressure I'm under every day?

30:44.870 --> 30:45.550
Fei.

30:48.240 --> 30:49.480
Come, have a seat.

30:53.160 --> 30:54.220
There is something

30:54.230 --> 30:55.690
I want to discuss with you.

30:56.710 --> 30:57.540
Go ahead.

30:59.190 --> 31:01.470
When we bought this house,

31:01.500 --> 31:03.300
to be honest, it was quite cheap.

31:03.590 --> 31:05.210
Now, I took a look,

31:06.150 --> 31:08.700
and its value
has gone up by at least 500,000.

31:08.870 --> 31:09.710
If...

31:09.790 --> 31:11.150
I mean if.

31:11.470 --> 31:13.020
If we sell this house

31:13.390 --> 31:15.250
and use the money for investment,

31:16.030 --> 31:17.170
wouldn't that be more suitable

31:17.170 --> 31:19.030
for our current situation?

31:21.480 --> 31:23.610
We are living too miserably right now.

31:23.640 --> 31:25.880
Wait. Do you want to sell this house?

31:28.110 --> 31:28.850
Back when we were

31:28.850 --> 31:31.030
kicked out in the middle of the night,
wasn't that miserable?

31:31.030 --> 31:32.550
At that time, I made up my mind

31:32.550 --> 31:34.230
that we must have a house of our own,

31:34.230 --> 31:36.190
a house where we'll never be kicked out.

31:36.190 --> 31:38.100
Fei, we are different now.

31:38.310 --> 31:40.470
I am a CFO now.

31:40.790 --> 31:41.450
Believe me.

31:41.670 --> 31:44.590
I will definitely do very well
within 3 years.

31:44.710 --> 31:46.480
I will buy a bigger and better house

31:46.480 --> 31:47.080
for you.

31:47.310 --> 31:48.740
We will take the best wedding photos

31:48.740 --> 31:50.550
and have the most expensive wedding, okay?

31:50.550 --> 31:52.080
No, that's not what I meant.

31:52.270 --> 31:53.190
I mean,

31:53.310 --> 31:55.310
we put in years of effort

31:55.340 --> 31:56.830
to get this house.

31:57.150 --> 31:58.670
And we both cherish it.

31:58.670 --> 32:00.350
Why would you just sell it?

32:01.830 --> 32:03.950
How can you be so sure that we can afford

32:03.950 --> 32:05.550
a more suitable house later?

32:05.950 --> 32:06.430
Right.

32:07.870 --> 32:08.870
I can't afford it.

32:09.870 --> 32:11.000
At the end of the day,

32:11.430 --> 32:12.890
you just don't believe me.

32:13.350 --> 32:15.150
No, that's not what I meant.

32:35.570 --> 32:41.750
♪ I ran into your eyes ♪

32:42.930 --> 32:48.850
♪ Trying to catch that pleasant light ♪

32:50.130 --> 32:56.160
♪ To embrace that fleeting moment
of happiness ♪

32:57.900 --> 33:04.040
♪ Sometimes I cry,
and sometimes I'm happy ♪

33:05.770 --> 33:11.420
♪ Sometimes I feel
I've captured the sweetness ♪

33:13.150 --> 33:19.030
♪ Sometimes, I run,
and sometimes, I fall ♪

33:15.100 --> 33:20.310
[I'm home. Where are you?]

33:20.200 --> 33:26.320
♪ Sometimes I feel
that having you is the best thing ♪

33:24.710 --> 33:26.030
Why were we arguing?

33:27.320 --> 33:32.660
♪ I've never seen a bright sea like you ♪

33:28.350 --> 33:31.940
[Ruohai, today is your birthday.]

33:31.960 --> 33:34.770
[I don't want to
talk about anything else.]

33:34.220 --> 33:40.470
♪ Every minute is colorful ♪

33:34.790 --> 33:42.610
[I just want to wish you a happy birthday
and hope you'll be happy forever.]

33:41.640 --> 33:47.520
♪ I've never experienced
such a warm love as yours ♪

33:48.970 --> 33:58.190
♪ In short, I won't let go of my hand ♪

34:04.680 --> 34:06.200
[Alarm]

34:09.139 --> 34:09.699
[Alarm]

34:14.400 --> 34:14.860
[Ruohai, today is your birthday.]

34:14.880 --> 34:15.420
[I don't want to
talk about anything else.]

34:15.440 --> 34:15.870
[I just want to wish you a happy birthday
and hope you'll be happy forever.]

34:24.000 --> 34:24.969
Why are you here?

34:25.090 --> 34:27.510
Is it about our work next month?

34:28.270 --> 34:30.000
I'm not here to talk about work.

34:30.060 --> 34:31.920
I'm here to talk about last night.

34:32.389 --> 34:33.650
What about last night?

34:34.989 --> 34:36.310
Mar—March in place.

34:39.820 --> 34:41.150
Isn't that Wang Ruohai?

34:45.870 --> 34:47.100
Who is this woman?

34:52.469 --> 34:53.350
They've left!

34:54.190 --> 34:54.590
Let me tell you,

34:54.590 --> 34:56.050
if Lu Ze hadn't stopped me,

34:56.110 --> 34:58.030
I would have rushed up and slapped you.

34:58.030 --> 35:00.070
But please
get the situation straight first.

35:00.070 --> 35:01.330
She was just my client.

35:01.350 --> 35:02.350
A regular client.

35:03.630 --> 35:05.590
Right, a regular client.

35:06.350 --> 35:07.710
Do you usually kiss and hug

35:07.710 --> 35:09.640
your regular clients after a meal?

35:10.830 --> 35:11.990
If you came here just

35:11.990 --> 35:13.050
to talk about this,

35:13.230 --> 35:14.750
please leave.

35:15.150 --> 35:17.390
You're pretty arrogant, Wang Ruohai.

35:18.150 --> 35:18.750
Tonight,

35:19.430 --> 35:21.890
you must explain everything clearly
to Fei.

35:22.110 --> 35:23.630
Otherwise, you'll see.

35:25.230 --> 35:26.280
Don't worry.

35:26.710 --> 35:28.840
I will definitely make it clear to her.

35:29.670 --> 35:30.110
Good.

35:30.910 --> 35:31.510
Be quick.

35:41.830 --> 35:42.980
Yeah.

35:43.390 --> 35:46.740
So I've been looking for an apartment
for him over the past couple of days.

35:46.740 --> 35:48.350
I don't know what he was thinking.

35:48.350 --> 35:50.080
He invested all his money in it.

35:50.190 --> 35:50.950
Now look,

35:51.230 --> 35:52.430
he has no savings left

35:52.870 --> 35:55.330
and can only live off his salary
every month.

35:58.790 --> 35:59.870
Wait a minute.

36:02.590 --> 36:08.390
[Protect People's Money and Build
a Strong Anti-fraud Safety Line Together]

36:02.790 --> 36:03.950
In the north,
there are the Chaoyang grannies;

36:03.950 --> 36:05.070
in the south,
there are the Jiangpu uncles.

36:05.070 --> 36:06.860
We'll protect people's money

36:06.920 --> 36:08.600
and never give scammers a chance!

36:08.600 --> 36:09.840
Bravo!

36:11.070 --> 36:12.310
Let me introduce someone to you.

36:12.310 --> 36:14.370
This is my childhood friend Li Yifei,

36:14.390 --> 36:16.430
a real financial expert in Lujiazui!

36:16.420 --> 36:18.790
[Protect People's Money and Build
a Strong Anti-fraud Safety Line Together]

36:16.470 --> 36:17.630
If you have any questions,

36:17.630 --> 36:18.850
you can ask him.

36:18.910 --> 36:21.060
To learn more about anti-fraud,

36:21.110 --> 36:22.390
please follow our official account,

36:22.390 --> 36:24.870
or scan the QR code
on our anti-fraud manual.

36:24.140 --> 36:27.430
[Protect People's Money and Build
a Strong Anti-fraud Safety Line Together]

36:24.950 --> 36:25.860
Thank you!

36:25.950 --> 36:27.070
Bravo!

36:27.390 --> 36:28.910
Bravo!

36:38.990 --> 36:39.620
Ms. Liao.

36:48.470 --> 36:50.870
I guess you're giving me
the answer I want.

36:52.950 --> 36:55.280
I told you,
this is a token of my sincerity.

36:55.310 --> 36:57.310
I'm relieved to see you wearing it.

36:59.990 --> 37:01.200
I've thought about it for a long time,

37:01.200 --> 37:02.750
and I've decided to join Shanlifang.

37:02.750 --> 37:04.350
Thank you for the opportunity, Ms. Liao.

37:04.350 --> 37:07.010
Congratulations
on making the right decision.

37:08.330 --> 37:10.240
Thank you for the invitation, Ms. Liao.

37:10.240 --> 37:12.640
I'll be relying on your support
from now on.

37:13.270 --> 37:15.110
I was supposed
to celebrate with you today,

37:15.110 --> 37:17.180
but I have to attend a banquet.

37:17.370 --> 37:19.190
Why don't you come with me?

37:20.150 --> 37:20.590
Okay.

37:21.510 --> 37:23.510
There might not be enough time
to go back and get changed.

37:23.510 --> 37:24.910
Let's just go buy something.

37:24.910 --> 37:26.430
Consider it a clothing allowance
from the company.

37:26.430 --> 37:28.330
I'll be your fashion consultant.

37:28.870 --> 37:31.130
I'll follow your arrangement, Ms. Liao.

37:38.670 --> 37:40.070
Is this your girlfriend?

37:40.830 --> 37:41.390
Yes.

37:45.070 --> 37:45.870
She is so cute.

37:50.110 --> 37:52.170
Why don't you change your wallet too?

37:52.990 --> 37:53.850
As you wish.

38:32.310 --> 38:33.370
How about this one?

38:34.230 --> 38:35.030
It looks nice.

38:56.880 --> 38:59.120
Then I'll pack your wallet and clothes

38:59.160 --> 38:59.770
together.

38:59.790 --> 39:00.670
Is that okay?

39:02.990 --> 39:03.790
Okay.

39:04.710 --> 39:05.150
Thank you.

39:05.150 --> 39:06.080
You're welcome.

39:16.070 --> 39:18.270
Thank you for dropping me off, Ms. Liao.

39:18.710 --> 39:19.380
No problem.

39:20.310 --> 39:21.630
I just felt a bit stuffy

39:22.030 --> 39:23.490
and needed some fresh air.

39:24.710 --> 39:26.510
Then I'll walk with you for a bit.

39:26.830 --> 39:27.480
Sure.

39:31.150 --> 39:32.190
Hello, Jingjing.

39:33.030 --> 39:34.970
You finally answered the phone.

39:35.390 --> 39:36.870
I was making a cake this afternoon

39:36.870 --> 39:37.790
and didn't hear it.

39:37.790 --> 39:39.320
I've been busy all evening.

39:40.190 --> 39:42.840
Okay. Did Wang Ruohai tell you?

39:43.790 --> 39:44.590
Tell me what?

39:44.620 --> 39:46.180
He hasn't even contacted me.

39:46.180 --> 39:47.960
He didn't even give you a call?

39:48.190 --> 39:48.870
No.

39:50.630 --> 39:52.710
We had a fight last night.

39:57.030 --> 39:59.150
Ruohai, happy birthday.

40:01.350 --> 40:02.080
Thank you.

40:02.830 --> 40:05.910
For this birthday, as your client,

40:06.030 --> 40:08.090
I can't be too affectionate with you.

40:08.670 --> 40:10.200
But for your next birthday,

40:10.550 --> 40:11.830
the one after that,

40:12.400 --> 40:13.860
and every birthday after,

40:14.870 --> 40:16.530
I hope I can celebrate for you,

40:18.190 --> 40:19.980
our CFO.

40:22.030 --> 40:23.140
Thank you, Ms. Liao.

40:23.140 --> 40:23.840
See?

40:24.230 --> 40:26.550
He could even cancel
a booked wedding banquet.

40:26.550 --> 40:29.280
I'm telling you,
he definitely has someone else.

40:29.950 --> 40:31.150
Don't talk nonsense.

40:32.710 --> 40:34.630
Really. I saw it last night.

40:34.670 --> 40:36.940
He was being very intimate with a woman.

40:37.350 --> 40:38.550
How is that possible?

40:38.550 --> 40:40.740
Anyone could cheat, but not my Ruohai.

40:48.550 --> 40:49.710
I'll be going now.

41:29.070 --> 41:30.600
How long have you been here?

41:30.870 --> 41:31.990
Not long.

41:32.190 --> 41:32.920
Um...

41:33.020 --> 41:34.950
I made this cake for you.

41:38.540 --> 41:39.780
Just ask.

41:52.750 --> 41:53.920
Is this watch...

41:53.950 --> 41:55.630
a birthday gift from her?

41:56.990 --> 41:57.990
She gave it to me,

41:59.070 --> 42:00.670
but it's not a birthday gift.

42:01.640 --> 42:02.500
Then what is it?

42:04.830 --> 42:06.230
I can't explain it to you.

42:07.710 --> 42:09.840
Do we have no trust between us anymore?

42:10.590 --> 42:11.350
I trust you.

42:11.390 --> 42:12.590
Of course I trust you.

42:12.630 --> 42:14.510
So if you say right now
that you'll always be with me

42:14.510 --> 42:16.910
and that you'll marry me,
I'll believe you.

42:17.750 --> 42:19.790
So the only way to prove my innocence

42:19.910 --> 42:21.970
is to propose to you right now, right?

42:22.510 --> 42:24.150
I'm not pressuring you.

42:24.270 --> 42:25.730
You're not pressuring me?

42:25.730 --> 42:26.990
You've even booked the wedding venue.

42:26.990 --> 42:28.230
Was it really my mom's idea,

42:28.230 --> 42:29.100
or yours?

42:29.190 --> 42:30.630
If you have to pressure me like this,

42:30.630 --> 42:32.290
we might as well just break up.

42:35.510 --> 42:36.600
What did you say?

42:37.180 --> 42:37.900
Break up?

42:40.740 --> 42:41.810
Let's break up.

42:44.470 --> 42:46.030
We have no common goal

42:46.470 --> 42:48.110
and don't understand each other.

42:48.110 --> 42:49.840
We don't even trust each other.

42:50.200 --> 42:52.330
What's the point of staying together?

42:52.440 --> 42:53.760
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:53.960 --> 42:55.200
Who are you guys?

42:55.220 --> 42:56.430
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

42:56.460 --> 42:58.570
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

42:58.670 --> 42:59.810
Let go of me!

42:59.850 --> 43:00.630
Come on!

43:01.440 --> 43:03.070
Let me go!

43:04.910 --> 43:07.490
Fine, I won't argue with you.

43:07.630 --> 43:09.790
I must have had terrible luck meeting you.

43:09.790 --> 43:10.790
Gui Lili, let's go!

43:10.790 --> 43:13.200
Even if she refunds the rent to us,

43:13.350 --> 43:15.380
we won't be able to find a better one.

43:16.560 --> 43:17.850
What are you doing?

43:18.920 --> 43:20.220
Stop it!
